# <%= packageName %>

<%= description %>

A `platform:node` registry-family package: a Drizzle-backed store over **one
shared SQLite file**, resolved via `@adhd/agent-core-env`'s
`resolveRegistryDbPath()` (precedence: `ADHD_AGENT_REGISTRY_DB_PATH` →
`REGISTRY_DATABASE_PATH` → `DATABASE_PATH` → the `@adhd/environment`-resolved
canonical default, `~/.adhd/agent-registry/production/data/registry.db`). It
owns the tables prefixed **`<%= tablePrefix %>`** and never ATTACHes another
database or declares a cross-package SQL foreign key — those keys are logical
and resolved at compile time. Get a connection via `@adhd/agent-core-env`'s
lazy `openRegistryDb()` — never a module-scope singleton; importing this
package must never open/create a file as a side effect.

Scaffolded by `@adhd/agent-nx` (`nx g @adhd/agent-nx:registry-package <%= baseName %>`).
The rules every registry package must follow live in
[`../agent-generator-plugin/REGISTRY-PACKAGE-RULES.md`](../agent-generator-plugin/REGISTRY-PACKAGE-RULES.md);
this package's local copy of the invariants is in [`./CLAUDE.md`](./CLAUDE.md).

## Layout

```
src/
  db/
    schema.ts         Drizzle tables — all prefixed `<%= tablePrefix %>`
    migrate-runner.ts FK-safe migrator (reused by tests + callers)
  __tests__/          real-DB, close+reopen store tests
  index.ts            public barrel (no db/sqlite singleton export)
drizzle/              drizzle-kit generated migrations (shipped in the package)
```

Get a connection with `@adhd/agent-core-env`:

```ts
import { openRegistryDb } from '@adhd/agent-core-env';
import { drizzle } from 'drizzle-orm/better-sqlite3';
import * as schema from './db/schema.js';

const { sqlite } = openRegistryDb();
const db = drizzle(sqlite, { schema });
```

## Commands

```bash
# Build (emits to dist/, ships the drizzle/ migrations as assets).
nx build <%= projectName %>

# Test (real on-disk SQLite + real migrations; gate on the EXIT CODE).
nx test <%= projectName %>

# Type-check without emitting.
nx typecheck <%= projectName %>

# Generate a new migration from src/db/schema.ts into ./drizzle.
nx db:generate <%= projectName %>

# Apply pending migrations to the database.
nx db:migrate <%= projectName %>
```

`build`, `test`, and `typecheck` inherit caching and the `^build` dependency
from the workspace `nx.json` `targetDefaults` — do not redefine `cache` or
`dependsOn` in this package's `project.json`.

## Adding a table

1. Define it in `src/db/schema.ts` with the `<%= tablePrefix %>` prefix.
2. `nx db:generate <%= projectName %>` to write the migration into `drizzle/`.
3. Export the table (and any store class) from `src/index.ts`.
4. Add a real-DB, close+reopen test under `src/__tests__/`.
